{"connection_id": "BC-3447277ee3a1aba172ca", "ref": "WLC:Ezek.18.30", "target": "sec17", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "Turn so wrongdoing will not become ruin", "note": "Ezekiel urges Israel to repent and turn from its transgressions lest iniquity become its downfall; this makes the warning’s practical benefit explicit."}
