{"connection_id": "BC-0dcb8a8f61c5fe7fec97", "ref": "WLC:Isa.55.7", "target": "sec17", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "The wicked are urged to turn and receive pardon", "note": "Isaiah tells the wicked to forsake their way and return to YHWH, who will have compassion and abundantly pardon; this shows prophetic admonition offered for a hearer’s benefit, not only to announce judgment."}
