{"connection_id": "BC-ce9770cd463c25809a14", "ref": "WLC:Prov.1.24", "target": "sec17", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "Wisdom calls and is refused", "note": "Personified Wisdom says she called and was refused and stretched out her hand without being heeded; this gives the bedbaht’s avoidance of offered admonition a specific scriptural scene."}
